WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:33.791
In the verse 15.1, 

2
00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:36.458
Lord Krishna showed the world

3
00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:38.500
as an inverted Ashwattha tree –

4
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.458
with roots above and branches
spreading below.

5
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:46.250
Now in this verse He explains in greater depth

6
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.458
how this tree spreads,

7
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:52.458
how it is nourished, and how the soul

8
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:55.166
becomes bound within it.

9
00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:02.083
Lord Krishna explains that the branches

10
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.083
of this inverted Ashwattha tree

11
00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:07.875
spread both upward and downward.

12
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:09.583
This means that according to their karma,

13
00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:15.000
jivatmas can rise to the devas
and higher realms,

14
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.541
or fall into animal

15
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:19.333
and other lower species.

16
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:22.708
The water that nourishes this tree

17
00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:28.000
is prakriti’s three gunas –
sattva, rajas, and tamas.

18
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.416
Wherever the influence of a
particular guna is stronger,

19
00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:32.833
the lifestyle and tendencies

20
00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:36.666
of that place take birth accordingly.

21
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:39.166
He explains that the small shoots

22
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.500
of this tree

23
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.125
are our sense-objects – sound,

24
00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:47.083
taste, smell, and form –

25
00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:50.041
which bind us again and again.

26
00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:53.125
Just as new shoots keep emerging
from branches,

27
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:55.708
in the same way the cravings of the senses

28
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:58.500
keep arising within us

29
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.375
and binding us.

30
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:04.625
The ears want to hear,

31
00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:08.583
the eyes want to see, the tongue wants to taste –

32
00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:10.500
and because of these desires,

33
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.458
our bondage deepens.

34
00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:17.333
Lord Krishna then explains that this tree

35
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:21.458
also has roots that spread downward.

36
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:24.875
These are our attractions, attachments,

37
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:26.333
and sanskaras –

38
00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:29.208
all born from karma.

39
00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:33.125
These roots bind us even more forcefully,

40
00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:35.708
especially in human life.

41
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:37.125
Because in the higher realms

42
00:02:37.125 --> 00:02:39.291
or other species, a being

43
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:42.375
only experiences the fruits of its past karma.

44
00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:44.791
But in human life alone there is the freedom

45
00:02:44.791 --> 00:02:46.916
to choose a new direction.

46
00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:50.500
It is here that our karma either
creates new bondage,

47
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.875
or opens the path to liberation.

48
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:53.791
This verse

49
00:02:53.791 --> 00:02:55.541
shows how complex

50
00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:58.041
this world is.

51
00:02:58.041 --> 00:03:01.958
Our senses, desires, and karma all together

52
00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.000
keep us entangled

53
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.791
in this twisted tree.

54
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:09.750
Until we understand its nature
with discernment,

55
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.958
we cannot be free.

56
00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.958
This is why Lord Krishna will explain further –

57
00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:17.416
we must reach the root of this tree,

58
00:03:17.416 --> 00:03:18.833
cut it down,

59
00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:22.375
and then move toward the eternal truth –

60
00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:26.083
where the Lord Himself dwells.

61
00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:33.583
Have you experienced this –

62
00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:38.833
sometimes the mind is completely
calm and clear, and sometimes

63
00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:42.708
restless or dull?

64
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:44.791
This is not coincidence.

65
00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.958
These are prakriti’s three gunas –

66
00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:51.041
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

67
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:53.750
exerting their influence within you.

68
00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.750
Everything you choose – what you watch,

69
00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.000
what you eat, who you spend time with,

70
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.833
which thoughts you give space to in your mind –

71
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:05.541
all of this together determines

72
00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:09.708
which guna will be nourished within you.

73
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:13.208
Just as water determines the growth of a tree,

74
00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:15.708
these three gunas

75
00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:19.458
give direction to your life-tree.

76
00:04:19.458 --> 00:04:22.625
For example –

77
00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:26.000
a student gets the opportunity

78
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.625
to visit another city

79
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:30.583
on an educational journey.

80
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:32.833
If they see it only

81
00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:36.458
as a chance to roam and have fun,

82
00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:41.333
they will waste their time even at
important sites –

83
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:42.750
only eating, drinking,

84
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.791
and taking photographs

85
00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:47.083
instead of gaining knowledge.

86
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:49.666
If you keep choosing rajas,

87
00:04:49.666 --> 00:04:52.791
desires and anxieties will only keep growing.

88
00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:56.125
If you feed tamas, the roots of laziness

89
00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:59.791
and confusion will deepen.

90
00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:03.708
But if you choose sattva –

91
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:08.500
through aware living, service, and knowledge –

92
00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:12.416
you begin to rise upward.

93
00:05:12.416 --> 00:05:15.791
This is the law of this inverted tree –

94
00:05:15.791 --> 00:05:19.166
your roots spread in the direction

95
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:22.833
of the guna you nourish within.

96
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:26.000
So pause and think –

97
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.333
which guna are you watering today?

98
00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:32.208
Your tree is growing, whether

99
00:05:32.208 --> 00:05:35.958
you pay attention or not.

100
00:05:35.958 --> 00:05:40.416
So I alert you –

101
00:05:40.416 --> 00:05:41.958
keep recognising the influence

102
00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:45.000
of all three gunas.

103
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.750
This awareness will keep you from going astray

104
00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:54.458
and will ultimately bring you closer to Me.

105
00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:56.000
Reflect on this.

106
00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:02.791
Often we feel that we love

107
00:06:02.791 --> 00:06:07.458
our loved ones deeply

108
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:12.958
and are taking care of them in every way.

109
00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:15.375
But sometimes,

110
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:18.750
what you call love –

111
00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:23.291
is in reality only

112
00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:25.916
attachment,

113
00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:29.666
on which you have placed a beautiful

114
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:32.500
cover of love.

115
00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.750
You stop your children

116
00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:38.333
from trying new things –
because somewhere within,

117
00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:41.958
there is fear of them failing.

118
00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:46.125
You suppress your partner’s truth –

119
00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:49.250
because that truth

120
00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:53.333
challenges your sense of control.

121
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:57.000
This happens repeatedly in families.

122
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.458
You say – ‘we are protecting,

123
00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:02.291
guiding, helping.’

124
00:07:02.291 --> 00:07:03.500
But think –

125
00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:08.458
are we truly freeing each other,

126
00:07:08.458 --> 00:07:09.500
or are we

127
00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.833
entangling ourselves further

128
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:13.208
in the branches of the inverted tree?

129
00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:15.583
Just as small shoots

130
00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:16.541
and roots

131
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:17.458
make the tree

132
00:07:17.458 --> 00:07:21.250
more entangled, in the same way
subtle bondages –

133
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.833
unspoken expectations,

134
00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:27.500
emotional dependence, fear of losing control –

135
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.541
bind the family in comfort,

136
00:07:30.541 --> 00:07:31.958
not in growth.

137
00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:33.000
True care

138
00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:37.208
is that which lifts and liberates.

139
00:07:37.208 --> 00:07:41.000
It trusts. It gives space.

140
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:44.666
Ask yourself – are your relationships

141
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:47.625
nourishing freedom,

142
00:07:47.625 --> 00:07:50.750
or deepening entanglement?

143
00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.458
If your sense of care arises from fear,

144
00:07:54.458 --> 00:07:57.083
then it is not love –

145
00:07:57.083 --> 00:07:59.875
it is just another root of this tree,

146
00:07:59.875 --> 00:08:01.708
binding you.

147
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:05.041
Understand – serve the family

148
00:08:05.041 --> 00:08:07.375
selflessly and lovingly.

149
00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:11.625
Do not place the bondage of control upon them.

150
00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:13.041
Such conduct

151
00:08:13.041 --> 00:08:17.166
brings the whole family on the path of liberation,

152
00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:18.791
toward Me.

153
00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:26.750
I always say –

154
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.458
in human life

155
00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:32.583
you have a unique power:

156
00:08:32.583 --> 00:08:35.916
not only to experience the fruits of karma,

157
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:39.625
but to create new karma.

158
00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:42.000
But think –

159
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.083
every ambition

160
00:08:44.083 --> 00:08:47.125
you hold on to, every result

161
00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:50.916
you cling to – that very rope

162
00:08:50.916 --> 00:08:54.000
binds you even tighter.

163
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.791
It begins with the desire to do well.

164
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:02.083
Then comes the hunger for recognition,

165
00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:05.291
the fear of losing something,

166
00:09:05.291 --> 00:09:08.375
the pressure to get ahead of others.

167
00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:11.875
Slowly you are not only doing work –

168
00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:15.458
you become entangled in all of this.

169
00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:17.375
At the office it feels as though

170
00:09:17.375 --> 00:09:21.333
you are climbing the ladder of progress.

171
00:09:21.333 --> 00:09:24.208
But if every step

172
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:28.333
is filled with restless desire,

173
00:09:28.333 --> 00:09:30.583
understand –

174
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:33.041
you are binding yourself in new

175
00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:35.625
roots with every move.

176
00:09:35.625 --> 00:09:38.000
This is

177
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.000
karma-anubandini

178
00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.791
manushya-loke.

179
00:09:42.791 --> 00:09:45.000
When desires become actions

180
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.458
without reflection, those very actions

181
00:09:49.458 --> 00:09:51.500
become shackles.

182
00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:55.125
You work very hard, but the emptiness within

183
00:09:55.125 --> 00:09:57.625
only grows.

184
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:00.083
So remember –

185
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:03.458
do your work not to prove yourself,

186
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:07.125
but to contribute.

187
00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:10.291
Not to impress, but

188
00:10:10.291 --> 00:10:13.791
to elevate yourself.

189
00:10:13.791 --> 00:10:15.250
This shift in perspective

190
00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.916
changes everything.

191
00:10:18.916 --> 00:10:21.458
Freedom at the workplace

192
00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:24.875
does not come from doing less work –

193
00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:27.541
it comes from wanting less.

194
00:10:27.541 --> 00:10:30.666
Real progress happens

195
00:10:30.666 --> 00:10:35.500
when actions are done without
entanglement and bondage.
